# ============================================================
# .gitignore — Real-Time Object Detection ML System
# ============================================================
# Design principle: exclude only what's LARGE and REGENERABLE.
# Everything Render / Streamlit Cloud need to serve out of the box
# — the champion registry, model cards, experiment results, PSI
# reference stats, and the demo image set — is deliberately NOT
# ignored below, so a fresh `git clone` + deploy works without
# re-running the training pipeline first.
# ============================================================

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.coverage

# ── Environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/

# ── OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Auto-downloaded benchmark dataset ────────────────────────
# coco128 (~7MB) re-downloads automatically on first use — not
# needed to serve the API/dashboard, only to re-run training.
# Ignored wherever it ends up (project root or notebooks/, in case
# a notebook run resolves the dataset path differently).
datasets/
notebooks/data/
notebooks/datasets/

# ── Ultralytics run artifacts / caches ───────────────────────
runs/
*.cache

# ── Pretrained YOLO weights — NEVER commit large binaries ────
# The Dockerfile re-downloads the champion's weights fresh at
# build time (see Dockerfile's RUN step, reads latest_model.json).
# Locally, ultralytics auto-downloads whichever weights are
# requested the first time YOLO(weights) is called.
*.pt
detection_models/*.pt

# ── Live-generated production logs ───────────────────────────
# Each deploy should accumulate its own prediction history rather
# than shipping with someone else's stale log data.
logs/*.csv

# ============================================================
# DELIBERATELY NOT IGNORED — required for Render / Streamlit Cloud
# ============================================================
#   data/demo_images/*.jpg        -> sample dataset, ships with the repo
#   detection_models/*.json       -> champion registry, model cards, challenger log
#   detection_models/*.csv        -> experiment results, PSI reference stats
#   docs/**                        -> architecture diagram, screenshots, gifs, reports
